<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Firstar upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Firstar upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth analyst Ben Crabtree said he upgraded Firstar Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Last half of 1997 should show much better efficiency, payback on technology investments,&quot; Crabtree said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the bank holding company were off 1/8 to 29-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
